OL,3,GNEWSAGaffe sees 'keep clear' lines
OL,4,Apainted on road outside school that
OL,5,Ashut 10 years ago
OL,6,
OL,7,FBright yellow "keep clear" school
OL,8,Fmarkings have been mistakenly painted
OL,9,Fon a road outside a school that has
OL,10,Fbeen closed for 10 years.
OL,12,FThe 30ft-long (9.1m) markings in
OL,13,FEnglish and Welsh were painted outside
OL,14,FYsgol y Fron in Holywell after Welsh
OL,15,FWater dug up the road for the sewer
OL,16,Fnetwork and was told to reinstate the
OL,17,Fcarriageway "on a like-for-like basis"
OL,18,Fby Flintshire council.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
