OL,3,GNEWSAGaffe sees 'keep clear' lines
OL,4,Apainted on road outside school that
OL,5,Ashut 10 years ago
OL,6,
OL,7,FHolywell resident Russell Price said
OL,8,Fthe error was "the talk of the town",
OL,9,Fadding: "It's a bit daft, the school
OL,10,Fhas been closed since 2016."
OL,12,FFlintshire council admitted the
OL,13,F"school-specific markings were no
OL,14,Flonger appropriate" and said it was
OL,15,F"rectifying" the problem.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
